      "created_at": "2015-01-31T18:38:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There's two things I would like to discuss/ask here. I like to have at least one wallpaper from all my favorite games to use on my laptop. Unfortunatley I was never able to find a good Sentinels one, so I have to ask you guys, do you know of any good Sentinels computer wallpapers that I just missed? If any of you know I would greatly apreciate it if you posted them below.</p><p>Second is something more about merchendise i would like to see. I don't like using the Sentinels sidekick app, I actually prefer the damage counters and little plaques with the Damage Dealt +1 and whatnot, and they have become a pretty iconic part of the game to me. But I was thinking, what if somebody had those as pins that you put on your shirt (not unlike the hero pins in the Sentinels store). I know for sure I'm probably not the only one who would wear one or two of those if they were to come out. Just a small suggestion for marketing/fan made stuff that I had in mind.</p>",
